        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leonardo’s Island – Origins</strong> is a prologue game to the upcoming <strong>Leonardo’s Island</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you’ll find an island-building system: gather resources, construct houses, bridges, and even forts, experiment, and enjoy the atmosphere of creativity and the freedom of building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Origins</strong> is a single-player game with 10 missions where you gather resources, unlock new building elements, and develop your island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb8962a8610fb2a4885895b147f35ad1.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Building\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb8962a8610fb2a4885895b147f35ad1.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb8962a8610fb2a4885895b147f35ad1.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Chop down trees and break stones to collect materials.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4322b4d319ac887c8fa98917e182b90d.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Resource gathering\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4322b4d319ac887c8fa98917e182b90d.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4322b4d319ac887c8fa98917e182b90d.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build houses, bridges, and even a fort to defend against pirates.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb303d392893a2a29a1e9aa46f3315cf.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Battles\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb303d392893a2a29a1e9aa46f3315cf.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb303d392893a2a29a1e9aa46f3315cf.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the underwater world, and on the island encounter rabbits and deer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions give you goals to follow, but you can always keep building freely. Even after finishing all missions, continue expanding your island for pleasure: surf the waves, fly a kite, or sail a catamaran.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4cfb0322ae6a29cb2245e721b2823a82.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Boat building\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4cfb0322ae6a29cb2245e721b2823a82.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4cfb0322ae6a29cb2245e721b2823a82.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Origins</strong> is a stand-alone game dedicated to creative island building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer’s Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing and supporting! Your support inspires me to keep going and brings the next chapter of <strong>Leonardo’s Island</strong> closer — with thrilling online battles and exciting sea regattas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leonardo’s Island – Origins</strong> is a prologue game to the upcoming <strong>Leonardo’s Island</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you’ll find an island-building system: gather resources, construct houses, bridges, and even forts, experiment, and enjoy the atmosphere of creativity and the freedom of building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Origins</strong> is a single-player game with 10 missions where you gather resources, unlock new building elements, and develop your island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb8962a8610fb2a4885895b147f35ad1.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Building\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb8962a8610fb2a4885895b147f35ad1.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb8962a8610fb2a4885895b147f35ad1.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Chop down trees and break stones to collect materials.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4322b4d319ac887c8fa98917e182b90d.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Resource gathering\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4322b4d319ac887c8fa98917e182b90d.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4322b4d319ac887c8fa98917e182b90d.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build houses, bridges, and even a fort to defend against pirates.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb303d392893a2a29a1e9aa46f3315cf.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Battles\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb303d392893a2a29a1e9aa46f3315cf.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/fb303d392893a2a29a1e9aa46f3315cf.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the underwater world, and on the island encounter rabbits and deer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions give you goals to follow, but you can always keep building freely. Even after finishing all missions, continue expanding your island for pleasure: surf the waves, fly a kite, or sail a catamaran.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4cfb0322ae6a29cb2245e721b2823a82.poster.avif?t=1758281182\" aria-label=\"Boat building\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4cfb0322ae6a29cb2245e721b2823a82.webm?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971310/extras/4cfb0322ae6a29cb2245e721b2823a82.mp4?t=1758281182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Origins</strong> is a stand-alone game dedicated to creative island building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer’s Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing and supporting! Your support inspires me to keep going and brings the next chapter of <strong>Leonardo’s Island</strong> closer — with thrilling online battles and exciting sea regattas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
